px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>地址：元朗教育路 146 號興業樓地下 1 號舖</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_36115b78f57a77e0-798\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"7bde465a-0c5d-4e29-b07c-7970cbb1cf48.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026I0nYI19oED1790046724.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"7bde465a-0c5d-4e29-b07c-7970cbb1cf48.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"e2cb9b60-5779-4cb0-82cb-3aad25267fde.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026IriE61lldA1790046724.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"e2cb9b60-5779-4cb0-82cb-3aad25267fde.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"d1f2921a-10a3-45bc-b9da-0d470c884672.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026A9ITto7wgW1790046725.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"d1f2921a-10a3-45bc-b9da-0d470c884672.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"979dcf4c-0221-4633-a575-99636ecdf727.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026ARhm7ZqHrZ1790046725.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"979dcf4c-0221-4633-a575-99636ecdf727.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-23T13:38:22.355221+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":276,"images":8,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}